{
  "id": "GEN.35",
  "number": "35",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genesis 35",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to Jacob, “Arise, go up to Bethel, and dwell there; and make there an altar to the God who appeared to you when you fled from your brother Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jacob said to his household and to all who were with him, “Put away the foreign gods that are among you, and purify yourselves, and change your garments; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then let us arise and go up to Bethel, that I may make there an altar to the God who answered me in the day of my distress and has been with me wherever I have gone.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they gave to Jacob all the foreign gods that they had, and the rings that were in their ears; and Jacob hid them under the oak which was near Shechem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as they journeyed, a terror from God fell upon the cities that were round about them, so that they did not pursue the sons of Jacob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob came to Luz (that is, Bethel), which is in the land of Canaan, he and all the people who were with him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and there he built an altar, and called the place El-bethel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "God of Bethel",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because there God had revealed himself to him when he fled from his brother. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Deborah, Rebekah's nurse, died, and she was buried under an oak below Bethel; so the name of it was called Allon-bacuth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Oak of weeping",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God appeared to Jacob again, when he came from Paddan-aram, and blessed him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God said to him, “Your name is Jacob; no longer shall your name be called Jacob, but Israel shall be your name.” So his name was called Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God said to him, “I am God Almighty:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "El Shaddai",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " be fruitful and multiply; a nation and a company of nations shall come from you, and kings shall spring from you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The land which I gave to Abraham and Isaac I will give to you, and I will give the land to your descendants after you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then God went up from him in the place where he had spoken with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob set up a pillar in the place where he had spoken with him, a pillar of stone; and he poured out a drink offering on it, and poured oil on it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jacob called the name of the place where God had spoken with him, Bethel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they journeyed from Bethel; and when they were still some distance from Ephrath, Rachel travailed, and she had hard labor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when she was in her hard labor, the midwife said to her, “Fear not; for now you will have another son.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as her soul was departing (for she died), she called his name Ben-oni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Son of my sorrow",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " but his father called his name Benjamin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Son of the right hand",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Son of the South",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Rachel died, and she was buried on the way to Ephrath (that is, Bethlehem), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Jacob set up a pillar upon her grave; it is the pillar of Rachel's tomb, which is there to this day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel journeyed on, and pitched his tent beyond the tower of Eder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Israel dwelt in that land Reuben went and lay with Bilhah his father's concubine; and Israel heard of it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the sons of Jacob were twelve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Leah: Reuben (Jacob's first-born), Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, and Zebulun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Rachel: Joseph and Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Bilhah, Rachel's maid: Dan and Naphtali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Zilpah, Leah's maid: Gad and Asher. These were the sons of Jacob who were born to him in Paddan-aram.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob came to his father Isaac at Mamre, or Kiriath-arba (that is, Hebron), where Abraham and Isaac had sojourned. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
